    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "U Baroorashadii Fircoon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana sannaddii laba iyo tobnaad, bisheedii laba iyo tobnaad, maalinteedii kowaad ayaa eraygii Rabbigu ii yimid isagoo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilka Aadamow, Fircoon oo ah boqorka Masar u barooro, oo waxaad isaga ku tidhaahdaa, Adiga waxaa laguu ekaysiiyey aaran libaax oo quruumaha, laakiinse waxaad tahay sida yaxaas badaha ku dhex jira. Webiyaashaadaad la butaacdaa, oo biyahana cagahaagaad ku qastaa, oo webiyaashoodana waad wasakhaysaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Shabaggaygaan kugu dul fidin doonaa iyadoo dadyow badan ila jiraan, oo iyaguna shabaggaygay kugu soo bixin doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaasaan dhulka kaaga tegi doonaa, oo berrin bannaan baan kugu xoori doonaa, oo waxaan ka dhigi doonaa inay haadka samada oo dhammu kugu dul fadhiyaan, oo dugaagga dunida oo dhan ayaan kaa dherjin doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo hilibkaaga ayaan buuraha ku dul dayn doonaa, oo dooxooyinkana waxaan ka buuxin doonaa taallooyin meydadkaaga ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dhiiggaagana waxaan ka waraabin doonaa dhulka aad ku dhex dabbaalatid iyo tan iyo buuraha, oo webiyaashuna adigay kaa wada buuxsami doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaan ku baabbi'iyo ayaan samada dabooli doonaa, oo xiddigaheedana waan madoobayn doonaa. Qorraxdana daruur baan ku qarin doonaa, oo dayaxuna iftiinkiisa sooma bixin doono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Iftiimmada dhalaalaya oo samada oo dhan ayaan korkaaga ku wada madoobayn doonaa, oo dalkaagana gudcur baan ku soo dejin doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaan halligaaddii aad quruumaha ku dhex halligantay u keeno waddammada aadan aqoonin ayaan dadyow badan qalbigood dhibi doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hubaal maalinta dhiciddaada waxaan ka dhigi doonaa inay dadyow badanu kula yaabaan, oo boqorradooduna aad bay kuugu baqi doonaan, markaan seeftayda hortooda ku ruxruxo, oo midkood kastaaba nafsaddiisuu daqiiqad kasta u gariiri doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Waxaa kugu soo degi doonta seeftii boqorka Baabuloon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaan ka dhigi doonaa in dadkaaga badanu ay seefaha kuwa xoogga badan ku wada le'daan. Waxay wada yihiin kuwa laga cabsado ee quruumaha, oo waxay dhici doonaan waxa Masar ku kibirtay, oo dadkeeda badan oo dhanna waa la wada baabbi'in doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo xayawaankeeda oo dhanna biyaha badan dhinacoodaan ka wada baabbi'in doonaa, oo mar dambe dad cagtiis ma ay qasi doonto oo duunyo qoobkeedna ma uu qasi doono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Markaasaan biyahooda inay miirmaan ka dhigi doonaa, oo webiyaashoodana waxaan ka dhigi doonaa inay sida saliid oo kale u shubmaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaan dalka Masar cidla iyo baabba' ka dhigo, oo uu waddanku waayo wixii uu ka buuxi jiray, oo markaan wada laayo waxa dhex deggan oo dhan ayay ogaan doonaan inaan anigu Rabbiga ahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Taasu waa baroorta iyada loogu barooran doono. Gabdhaha quruumuhuna way ku barooran doonaan. Waxay ugu barooran doonaan Masar iyo dadkiisa badan oo dhanba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana sannaddii laba iyo tobnaad, maalintii shan iyo tobnaad oo bisha ayaa eraygii Rabbigu ii yimid isagoo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilka Aadamow, dadka badan ee Masar u barooro, oo iyaga tuur; xataa Masar iyo gabdhaha quruumaha caanka ahba waxaad ku dhex tuurtaa dhulka meelaha ugu hooseeya iyaga iyo kuwa yaamayska ku dhaadhacaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal yaad ka qurux badan tahay? Hoos u dhaadhac, oo buuryaqabyada la jiifso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxay ku dhex dhici doonaan kuwa seefta lagu laayay, oo seeftaa loo gacangeliyey. Masar iyo dadkeeda badanba wada jiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwa xoogga badan madaxdooda ayaa iyada iyo caawimayaasheeda She'ool kala dhex hadli doona. Hoos bay u dhaadheceen, wayna jiifaan, iyagoo buuryaqabyo ah oo seefta lagu laayay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reer Ashuur iyo guutadiisii oo dhammu halkaasay joogaan, oo qabuurahoodiina iyagay ku wareegsan yihiin, iyagoo kulligood la laayay, oo seef ku le'day. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qabuurahoodu waxay ku yaalliin yaamayska meelaha ugu hooseeya, oo guutadiisuna waxay ku wareegsan tahay qabrigiisa. Kuwii dalka kuwa nool cabsi gelin jiray oo dhan waa la wada laayay, oo seef bay ku le'deen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaana jooga reer Ceelaam iyo dadkiisa badan oo qabrigiisa ku wada wareegsan oo dhan. Kuwii dalka kuwa nool cabsi gelin jiray oo dhan waa la laayay oo seef bay ku le'deen. Iyagoo buuryaqabyo ah ayay dhulka meelaha ugu hooseeya hoos ugu dhaadheceen, oo ceebtooday kuwa yaamayska ku dhaadhaca la qaateen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sariir baa kuwa la laayay dhexdooda loo diyaariyey isaga iyo dadkiisa badanba. Qabuurihiisii isagay ku wareegsan yihiin, oo kulligood iyagoo buuryaqabyo ah ayay seef ku le'deen, waayo, cabsi bay dalka kuwa nool gelin jireen, oo ceebtooday kuwa yaamayska ku dhaadhaca la qaateen: oo isaga waxaa la dhigay kuwa la laayay dhexdooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halkaas waxaa jooga reer Mesheg iyo reer Tubal iyo dadkooda badan oo dhan, oo qabuurahoodiina iyagay ku wareegsan yihiin, oo kulligood iyagoo buuryaqabyo ah ayay seef ku le'deen, waayo, cabsi bay dalka kuwa nool gelin jireen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iyagu lama ay jiifsan doonaan kuwa xoogga badan oo ka le'day kuwa buuryaqabyada ah oo She'ool hoos ugu dhaadhacay iyagoo hubkoodii dagaalka sita, oo seefahoodii madaxooda la hoos dhigay, dembigooduna lafahooduu dul saaran yahay, waayo, iyagu cabsi bay dalka kuwa nool gelin jireen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse adigu waxaad ku dhex jabi doontaa kuwa buuryaqabyada ah, oo waxaad la jiifsan doontaa kuwa seefta lagu laayay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halkaas waxaa jooga reer Edom, iyo boqorradiisii, iyo amiirradiisii oo dhan, kuwaas oo in kastoo ay xoog badnaayeen la dhinac dhigay kuwii seefta lagu laayay, oo iyana waxay la jiifsan doonaan kuwa buuryaqabyada ah iyo kuwa yaamayska ku dhaadhaca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.29"
            ]
          }
